('8', 'disclaimer_html', 'ATP SERVICES – PROFESSIONAL PRACTICE DISCLAIMER\r\n\r\nThis email and any attachments are confidential and intended solely for the named recipient. It may contain privileged financial, taxation, payroll, statutory compliance or advisory information of Accounting, Taxation and Payroll (Pty) Ltd (“ATP Services”). Unauthorised review, use, disclosure, copying or distribution is strictly prohibited. If received in error, please notify the sender immediately and permanently delete this communication.\r\n\r\nATP Services renders professional services in accordance with applicable South African legislation, regulatory frameworks and recognised professional and ethical standards. No statement, opinion or advice contained herein shall constitute binding professional advice unless issued pursuant to a formally executed engagement letter or written service agreement.\r\n\r\nAll statutory submissions, including but not limited to SARS, CIPC, PAYE, VAT, EMP201, EMP501, Income Tax and related regulatory filings, are prepared based on information supplied by the client. Ultimate responsibility for the accuracy, completeness and validity of such information remains with the client unless expressly agreed otherwise in writing.\r\n\r\nATP Services maintains strict governance, confidentiality and data protection protocols in compliance with the Protection of Personal Information Act, 2013 (POPIA). Information contained in this communication may not be reproduced or disclosed without proper authority.\r\n\r\nFor security reasons, ATP Services will never amend banking details via email. Any payment instruction changes must be verified telephonically using independently obtained contact details. ATP Services accepts no liability for losses arising from cyber fraud, interception, manipulation or unauthorised alteration of electronic communications.\r\n\r\nTo the fullest extent permitted by law, ATP Services disclaims liability for any indirect, consequential or incidental damages arising from reliance on this communication outside the scope of a formal engagement.', '2026-03-01 07:14:17', '2026-03-01 07:18:48'),
